### List active users
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get one active user
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get effective permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{userId}}/permisos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
